WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
And the girl from the Su family is still cooking.

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:05,160
I just saw Li Changsheng running out.

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,640
He won't run away on his own, right?

4
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:09,320
Sister, listen to my sister-in-law’s advice.

5
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:11,040
Take the child back to her parents' house quickly

6
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:13,760
Sister-in-law, you don’t have to worry about my family affairs.

7
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:14,960
Don't know what's good or bad

8
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:17,400
Li Changsheng's kind of mud would have died in the mountains long ago.

9
00:00:19,390 --> 00:00:21,310
Why are you back? Didn't you run away?

10
00:00:21,590 --> 00:00:33,780
If you dare to talk too much, will your tongue be heated by boiling water?

11
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:35,600
I'll deal with the rabbit first

12
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,980
Could this meat be the last supper?

13
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:46,690
We're full. Okay, we two got a good price.

14
00:00:50,460 --> 00:00:52,940
Mom, can Niuniu have a bite?

15
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:55,220
Eat it, be careful it's hot

16
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:05,720
Eat. Dad will never let you go hungry again.

17
00:01:07,720 --> 00:01:10,320
If you dare to send Niuniu away, I will fight you to the death

18
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:13,520
I will repay the debt and I will support my family well in the future.

19
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:16,550
I believe you, Mo
